tools/design-tokens/fixtures/

pnpm-lock.yaml
node_modules/
coverage/
.next/
apps/api/

# ⚠ ALL MARKDOWN, not just docs/. Prettier reformatted CLAUDE.md on its first run --
# *emphasis* to _emphasis_ and a reflowed table -- which is a diff nobody authored in a
# file that is this repository's agent entry point. The project's prose is written by hand
# and reviewed by hand; a formatter's opinion about it is noise in every future diff and
# would make a real edit hard to see.
*.md
docs/

